    }
</style>

<div class="rba-card">
    <h2>Scholarships</h2>

<p>
    Scholarships are available for qualifying families. <b>Please note</b>: You must complete the scholarship application, submit it with proof of income and assistance, and be approved <b>BEFORE</b> registering your child. Player placement is on a first come, first served basis. Please submit your completed scholarship application early, as the approval process can take up to two weeks. Families with more than one child participating may qualify for a discount for each additional child. For any questions, call 218-576-6174.
</p>

<p>
    Scholarships are made available in part by The Brady VanHove Memorial Scholarship and other sponsors.
</p>

<p>
    Fill out an <a href="https://uscsalvationarmy.wufoo.com/forms/rba-scholarship-application/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">RBA Scholarship Application.</a>
</p>

</div>

<div class="rba-card">
